enterprise Research expertise Find an expert Institutes and centres Faculties and schools Research facilities and capabilities Library Collaborate with ACU Innovate and research Join us on campus Connect with students Engage our candidates Graduate research Research degrees How to apply Find a scholarship Join a research project Meet our supervisors Why research at ACU Support and resources Research Enterprise Researcher development Graduate research Research supervision Office of the Deputy Vice-Chancellor (Research and Enterprise) Graduate Research School Research vision 2033 Our focus Core themes Strategic priorities Contact us Find a research supervisor About ACU About ACU Reputation and ranking Vision 2033 Vision 2033 Plans Leadership and governance Organisational structure Government and public policy Vice-Chancellor and President Faith and Values What if I'm not Catholic? Community giving Community engagement Community-initiated research Sustainability at ACU News Events Careers at ACU Arts and culture hub Widening participation Employers and industry Our partnerships Research partners Publications Handbook by year First Peoples Directorate Empowering veterans Student veteran services Policies and procedures Professional Standards and Integrity Search Faculties, directorates and staff Faculty of Education and Arts Faculty of Health Sciences Faculty of Law and Business Faculty of Theology and Philosophy Directorates Institutes, academies and centres Search Search Search by keyword, course.. Show Me Everything Everything Courses Researcher Search Faith and Values Industry Alumni Giving to ACU Safety at ACU Current students Library Staff Contact us Search by keyword, course.. Show Me Everything Courses Researcher Search Search Menu ☰ Close X Home > Study at ACU > Career advisors Career advisors As a careers advisor, you hold futures in your hands. We want to help you guide your students into the best future for them – so here you’ll find all of the information you need about our courses, admission pathways and more. Quicklinks Update your details Order publications Course guides and useful resources Advisory conference Arrange a visit Contact us Courses New courses Entry and pathways ACU Guarantee Scholarships Events for future students VET qualification selection ranks A place to go places When your students become our students, they'll join a vibrant, inclusive community that values more than just words in a textbook. They will learn in world-leading facilities, make lifelong friends and build a world of memories. VET pathways to ACU We have partnerships with vocational education and training (VET) providers around the country. Graduates from our education partners are eligible for credit and/or guaranteed entry to our undergraduate courses. Discover VET pathways Visit a campus Enjoy a full on-campus experience when you book a tour with our friendly Future Students team who will show you and your students around and introduce them to university life. Arrange a visit Events to discover study and career options We run a range of events throughout the year to help your students with their study options. Explore what's on offer A different way to a degree There’s no right or wrong way to get into university. We offer a number of entry schemes and admission pathways that may become your students' access to ACU courses. View our admission pathways A different way to a degree More info A different way to a degree ACU Guarantee Our ACU Guarantee entry program assesses your students for entry into ACU based on their Year 11 results, and offers may be made as early as July. While they’ll still need to complete Year 12 exams, they can feel confident that their marks from Year 11 meet our entry requirements. Learn more Recent secondary education Your students are preparing for life after year 12 and worried about the next step. We get it. Learn what admission options are available and walk them through the adjustment factors they may be eligible for. What comes after school Didn’t get the marks? Not getting the right ATAR or rank needn’t spell disaster. We offer a number of entry options to ensure your students don’t have to give up on their university dreams. Explore all the options Vocational education There are many pathways into a degree, and many pathways into a job. Vocational education is an excellent stepping stone for studying a degree and we recognise TAFE or registered training organisation (RTO) qualifications. View vocational education and training More info Order publications Download or order course guides and brochures to help you, and your students, make the best choices for their university career. Learn more about admission pathways, the application process and course requirements. Get yours now Stories for your students Looking for compelling stories, inspiring research, and big ideas to share with your students? Or simply have a spare space to fill in your latest newsletter? You can find stories to inform, challenge and inspire in Impact . Read more Get the latest news Keep up to date with the latest in course information and entry requirements. Update your details Ask us a question Unsure how to best help a student? Get in touch with our Future Students team, who will help you help them. Contact us Back to previous page Have a question? We're available 9am–5pm AEST, Monday to Friday If you’ve got a question, our AskACU team has you covered. You can search FAQs, email, live chat, call – whatever works for you. Live chat with us now Chat to our team for real-time answers to your questions. Launch live chat Visit our FAQs page Find answers to some commonly asked questions. See our FAQs Ask a question Call 1300 275 228 About ACU Faith and Values Working at ACU Giving to ACU Contact us Our campuses Ballarat Blacktown Brisbane Canberra Melbourne North Sydney Rome Strathfield ACU Online Connect with us Study online with us Still have questions? Accessibility Copyright Disclaimer