third parties when you browse ACU’s website. ACU’s website uses different types of cookies. Some cookies are placed by third party services that appear on our pages with whom we share information about your use of our site, for example our social media, advertising and analytics partners who may personalise advertisements to you on third party websites. These third parties can be located overseas, including the USA, Ireland, UK and the Netherlands. You can at any time change or withdraw your consent from the Cookie Declaration on our website. Learn more about how we manage personal information, how you may access and correct your personal information, how you can complain about a breach of privacy and how you can contact us, in our Privacy Policy . Do not sell or share my personal information Allow all cookies Customize Allow selection Use necessary cookies only Skip to content Study at ACU Study at ACU Find a course New courses ACU Online Short courses Course types explained Course guides Core Curriculum Why study at ACU How to apply Undergraduate students Postgraduate students Short courses and individual units Entry programs and pathways Find your pathway or entry program I have completed military service I am Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander I am a first responder Undergraduate study at ACU Non School Leavers at ACU Postgraduate study at ACU International study at ACU Research study at ACU Study overseas Fees and scholarships Domestic student fees International student fees Scholarships Financing your studies Responding to an offer Accept your offer and enrol Orientation Defer your offer or withdraw Credit and prior learning Leadership academy Important dates Future students events Career advisors How parents can help Faith and Values Student forms ACU Guarantee applications are now open - closing 14 September 2026. International students International students ACU中文官网 Access International Course Guide online Download student guides Student and alumni storie