rprise Research expertise Find an expert Institutes and centres Faculties and schools Research facilities and capabilities Library Collaborate with ACU Innovate and research Join us on campus Connect with students Engage our candidates Graduate research Research degrees How to apply Find a scholarship Join a research project Meet our supervisors Why research at ACU Support and resources Research Enterprise Researcher development Graduate research Research supervision Office of the Deputy Vice-Chancellor (Research and Enterprise) Graduate Research School Research vision 2033 Our focus Core themes Strategic priorities Contact us Find a research supervisor About ACU About ACU Reputation and ranking Vision 2033 Vision 2033 Plans Leadership and governance Organisational structure Government and public policy Vice-Chancellor and President Faith and Values What if I'm not Catholic? Community giving Community engagement Community-initiated research Sustainability at ACU News Events Careers at ACU Arts and culture hub Widening participation Employers and industry Our partnerships Research partners Publications Handbook by year First Peoples Directorate Empowering veterans Student veteran services Policies and procedures Professional Standards and Integrity Search Faculties, directorates and staff Faculty of Education and Arts Faculty of Health Sciences Faculty of Law and Business Faculty of Theology and Philosophy Directorates Institutes, academies and centres Search Search Search by keyword, course.. Show Me Everything Everything Courses Researcher Search Faith and Values Industry Alumni Giving to ACU Safety at ACU Current students Library Staff Contact us Search by keyword, course.. Show Me Everything Courses Researcher Search Search Menu ☰ Close X Home > About ACU > Careers at ACU > How to apply How to apply Choose a career journey filled with excitement and fulfilment. Find out everything you’ll need to apply for a role at ACU, including current vacancies, advice on preparing your application, and notes on what to expect at your interview. A career for the greater good We’re more than just a public university. We’re dedicated to helping those in need. We connect with our local communities and overseas through outreach programs. We champion the dignity of the human person. We pursue research and teaching excellence. And we want you to help us. Follow the links below to browse available vacancies, get your application underway, and prepare for the interview process. Along the way, you’ll discover more reasons why ACU is an employer of choice. Learn why you should work at ACU Career FAQs Don’t let any questions go unanswered. Read our frequently asked questions about working at ACU or your job application, and learn how to get in touch. Find answers Existing applicants If you already have a job application underway, log in to our careers portal to continue the application process. Log in now International applicants Applying from another country? Find out where to access visa information and learn more about living and working in Australia. Life down under Back to previous page Have a question? We're available 9am–5pm AEST, Monday to Friday If you’ve got a question, our AskACU team has you covered. You can search FAQs, email, live chat, call – whatever works for you. Live chat with us now Chat to our team for real-time answers to your questions. Launch live chat Visit our FAQs page Find answers to some commonly asked questions. See our FAQs Ask a question Call 1300 275 228 About ACU Faith and Values Working at ACU Giving to ACU Contact us Our campuses Ballarat Blacktown Brisbane Canberra Melbourne North Sydney Rome Strathfield ACU Online Connect with us Study online with us Still have questions? Accessibility Copyright Disclaimer Privacy Safety Copyright ©Australian Catholic University 1998-2026 ABN 15050192660 Provider Number PRV12008 CRICOS Reg 00004G Australian Catholic University acknowledges the traditional custodians of the lands on which we live and work, and we pay our respects to Elders both past and present."
